@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = REPLACE_WITH_DISTRIBUTOR_TOKEN
@eventGridToken = REPLACE_WITH_EVENTGRID_TOKEN

### Web client
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Proxy authenticated app request
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/manuscripts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Distributor stock callback
POST {{baseUrl}}/callbacks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":"callback-1","eventType":"StockUpdated","subject":"tenants/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/books/REPLACE_BOOK_ID","eventTime":"2026-10-31T14:00:00Z","dataVersion":"1","data":{"tenantId":"11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111","sequence":1,"bookId":"REPLACE_BOOK_ID","distributorId":"distributor","quantity":100}}

### Event Grid synchronous validation handshake
POST {{baseUrl}}/events/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{eventGridToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[{"id":"validation","eventType":"Microsoft.EventGrid.SubscriptionValidationEvent","data":{"validationCode":"sample-code"}}]

### Missing credentials (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/manuscripts

### Liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Public OpenAPI including concrete proxied application routes (Development only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json
